  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-view qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-1rPlC11H\">用于创意标题时的动态词包，本接口可以查询已有创意词词包id</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-LVlVVCet\">使用方式例如：创建创意时设置标题为「{地区}人都喜欢吃的小吃」，可自动填充用户当前地区</p><div class=\"qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-A48I68Ef%5C%22%3E%3Cspan%20style%3D%5C%22color%3A%20%23333333%3B%5C%22%3E%E7%9B%AE%E5%89%8D%E4%BB%85%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2%E8%AF%8D%E5%8C%85%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E6%96%B0%E8%AF%8D%E5%8C%85%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%229zrWF%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg height=\"24\" p-id=\"13148\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.